    <h1>Wix vs. <em>a custom-coded site.</em></h1>
    <p>I would rather you pick the right tool than pick me. Wix is fine for some businesses. For others it is the wrong shape entirely. Here is the honest tradeoff, in plain language, with the cases where each one wins.</p>
